WEBVTT

01:40.180 --> 01:44.800
=Love Story in the 1970s=

01:44.980 --> 01:47.740
=Episode 16=

01:49.279 --> 01:50.440
Do you know the compass?

01:51.080 --> 01:51.919
Yes.

01:55.880 --> 01:57.640
A compass can tell you where north is.

01:57.893 --> 01:59.930
But you have to look up
and see the road yourself

01:59.937 --> 02:00.960
to reach north.

02:02.720 --> 02:03.919
It's good to have a goal,

02:04.440 --> 02:06.115
but it can't be the only thing you see.

02:06.919 --> 02:08.119
If you want to head north,

02:08.399 --> 02:09.839
there can't be a straight road

02:09.839 --> 02:10.800
leading north.

02:11.520 --> 02:12.879
Sometimes you have to turn east,

02:12.879 --> 02:15.200
turn west, or even step back south.

02:15.599 --> 02:16.920
You have to learn to rest

02:18.000 --> 02:19.320
and enjoy the scenery on the way.

02:34.080 --> 02:35.399
Besides going to college,

02:35.839 --> 02:36.920
what else do you

02:37.119 --> 02:38.640
normally like to do?

02:47.320 --> 02:48.480
For example, making clothes.

02:49.480 --> 02:50.439
I heard from your dad

02:50.439 --> 02:51.719
that you're really good at it.

02:52.520 --> 02:53.520
His clothes,

02:53.560 --> 02:54.399
your mom's clothes,

02:54.400 --> 02:56.320
and the neighbors' clothes
were all made by you.

02:56.520 --> 02:57.719
And that three-color shirt

02:58.080 --> 02:58.999
was very stylish.

03:01.920 --> 03:04.080
I'll make a few more for you then.

03:04.320 --> 03:05.119
Sure.

03:06.200 --> 03:08.279
Sometimes I wonder,

03:08.279 --> 03:09.920
I've woven so much fabric,

03:09.920 --> 03:12.719
what kind of clothes did they become?

03:14.640 --> 03:17.999
If one day I can be a designer,

03:17.999 --> 03:19.920
I'll make the clothes I design

03:19.920 --> 03:20.920
with my own hands.

03:21.200 --> 03:21.679
Sure.

03:22.200 --> 03:23.279
Be a designer.

03:23.640 --> 03:24.879
Tell me your ideas.

03:24.879 --> 03:25.839
I'll draw them for you.

03:26.879 --> 03:28.439
When I watch foreign movies,

03:28.520 --> 03:30.279
I think the clothes they wear

03:30.279 --> 03:31.320
look really nice.

03:31.520 --> 03:32.920
Can you draw them for me?

03:33.279 --> 03:35.640
I want to turn them
into design sketches.

03:38.520 --> 03:40.040
You're teachable.

03:51.460 --> 03:59.340
(Fighting North and South)

04:03.480 --> 04:04.119
This one, right?

04:04.119 --> 04:04.920
Yes.

04:04.982 --> 04:06.710
(The Bronze Bust, Albania)
This one looks good.

04:06.719 --> 04:08.430
It's too dark.
I'll sketch it roughly first

04:08.430 --> 04:09.226
and finish at home.

04:13.480 --> 04:14.800
This one looks good, too.

04:15.200 --> 04:16.279
Hers is nice, too.

04:16.279 --> 04:17.039
That one.

04:17.039 --> 04:17.839
Which one?

04:17.839 --> 04:19.200
That one. The one she's wearing.

04:19.200 --> 04:19.640
Sure.

04:23.039 --> 04:24.680
Did you draw that dress?

04:24.680 --> 04:25.719
That one. It's that one.

04:25.719 --> 04:27.680
Hurry, they'll switch soon.

04:30.520 --> 04:31.599
Hers is nice, too.

04:32.799 --> 04:33.440
This one.

04:34.080 --> 04:35.320
That one's nice, too.

04:35.320 --> 04:36.279
I already drew that.

04:36.279 --> 04:37.120
What about her hat?

04:37.120 --> 04:37.640
Comrades.

04:37.919 --> 04:39.120
Can you keep it down?

04:39.919 --> 04:41.120
- Sorry.
- Sorry about that.

04:59.919 --> 05:00.680
How is it?

05:01.000 --> 05:02.680
You drew so well.

05:02.799 --> 05:04.320
I was afraid you couldn't.

05:04.337 --> 05:05.200
If you didn't rush me,

05:05.200 --> 05:06.320
I could draw even faster.

05:06.919 --> 05:07.709
It's my fault.

05:07.710 --> 05:09.937
I'll treat you to more movies.

05:10.120 --> 05:11.399
Let me see what's on tomorrow.

05:11.537 --> 05:13.715
(Workers' Club Film Picks:
Bronze Bust, The Waves of the Danube)

05:16.120 --> 05:17.279
I suddenly dislike movies.

05:17.479 --> 05:18.159
Fang Muyang.

05:18.719 --> 05:19.279
Come here.

05:19.599 --> 05:20.399
Coming.

05:20.399 --> 05:21.399
Does this look good?

05:23.120 --> 05:23.719
This pink one?

05:23.719 --> 05:24.159
Right?

05:24.159 --> 05:24.680
I'll draw it.

05:25.000 --> 05:26.760
I think this purple one is nice, too.

05:27.440 --> 05:28.120
What about this?

05:28.120 --> 05:29.120
This one's nice, too.

05:34.140 --> 05:36.626
(Workers' Club Film Picks
Bronze Bust The Waves of the Danube)

05:36.671 --> 05:38.580
(Walter Defends Sarajevo)

05:38.580 --> 05:41.300
(Gjurma, The Flower Girl)

06:06.648 --> 06:10.060
(Staff Canteen)

06:12.839 --> 06:14.320
The canteen food lately

06:14.320 --> 06:15.839
has no taste at all.

06:16.039 --> 06:16.880
It's bland.

06:17.279 --> 06:18.080
Ms. Liu, Fei Ni.

06:18.080 --> 06:19.026
Take your time eating.

06:19.048 --> 06:19.826
I'll go first.

06:19.880 --> 06:20.737
You're done eating?

06:26.080 --> 06:28.520
Ms. Liu, let me show you something.

06:28.640 --> 06:29.839
Keep it a secret for me.

06:30.200 --> 06:30.919
What is it?

06:37.520 --> 06:38.320
Take a look.

06:44.279 --> 06:45.200
I designed it.

06:46.680 --> 06:47.799
You designed it?

06:49.000 --> 06:49.440
Of course.

06:49.440 --> 06:51.760
These are based on foreign films.

06:51.760 --> 06:54.120
I adjusted them a bit,

06:54.120 --> 06:56.599
according to our workshop materials.
What do you think?

06:58.279 --> 06:59.919
Fei Ni.

06:59.919 --> 07:01.919
Having you run a loom

07:01.919 --> 07:03.520
is such a waste of talent.

07:03.680 --> 07:04.640
Look at these.

07:07.640 --> 07:09.279
You should go to a garment factory.

07:09.760 --> 07:10.279
No.

07:11.271 --> 07:12.440
The Light Industry Bureau.

07:13.080 --> 07:15.279
Stop praising me.

07:15.279 --> 07:16.520
I just sketched randomly.

07:16.520 --> 07:18.200
You think it's okay?

07:18.320 --> 07:20.000
I think you're amazing.

07:20.000 --> 07:20.560
Really?

07:20.560 --> 07:21.919
I've been in the workshop so...

07:22.760 --> 07:23.440
You...

07:25.799 --> 07:27.159
What are you doing?

07:31.520 --> 07:32.440
What is this?

07:34.159 --> 07:35.000
Feng Lin.

07:35.200 --> 07:37.320
These are clothing designs by Fei Ni.

07:41.320 --> 07:42.479
Fei Ni.

07:42.919 --> 07:44.359
You're a textile worker.

07:44.799 --> 07:46.120
Why are you doing fashion design?

07:46.479 --> 07:48.279
Can you just do your own job well?

07:51.399 --> 07:52.320
Feng Lin.

07:53.248 --> 07:55.080
What part of my job
have I not done well?

07:57.799 --> 07:59.919
You're being hazy!

07:59.919 --> 08:00.839
You mean lazy?

08:03.479 --> 08:04.919
You're neglecting your duty.

08:05.080 --> 08:06.680
Instead of staying at your post

08:06.680 --> 08:07.880
to build socialism,

08:07.880 --> 08:09.839
a screw like you has rusted.

08:13.680 --> 08:14.080
You...

08:22.320 --> 08:23.680
Why did she tear it?

08:25.399 --> 08:26.080
You...

08:31.279 --> 08:32.999
This is all my fault.

08:32.999 --> 08:35.040
I didn't hold it properly.

08:35.204 --> 08:35.960
What should we do?

08:35.960 --> 08:36.489
This...

08:36.490 --> 08:37.359
It's alright, Ms. Liu.

08:37.359 --> 08:37.920
I...

08:41.479 --> 08:42.639
Some things

08:43.440 --> 08:45.680
just need a few more turns.

08:48.479 --> 08:49.519
What do you mean?

09:15.719 --> 09:16.639
Fang is back.

09:16.920 --> 09:17.519
I'm back.

09:26.040 --> 09:27.080
You're home?

09:27.920 --> 09:29.639
I just got back.

09:32.137 --> 09:33.680
Did you show Ms. Liu the drawings?

09:35.920 --> 09:36.719
Yes.

09:37.680 --> 09:39.080
How was it? Did she like them?

09:40.519 --> 09:41.200
Yes.

09:41.999 --> 09:45.680
She said I'm wasting my talent
at the textile factory

09:45.920 --> 09:47.599
and should stay at a garment factory.

09:48.879 --> 09:49.719
She's right.

09:52.560 --> 09:53.630
Where are the drawings?

09:54.680 --> 09:55.479
I'll revise them

09:55.479 --> 09:56.320
and improve them.

09:57.119 --> 09:57.920
I...

09:58.200 --> 09:59.639
I gave them to Ms. Liu.

10:01.119 --> 10:02.320
Why give them to her?

10:03.080 --> 10:04.639
She liked them, so I did.

10:04.879 --> 10:05.759
Anyway,

10:06.599 --> 10:07.440
I'll draw more.

10:13.320 --> 10:14.479
I'll go

10:15.999 --> 10:16.920
get some water.

10:59.820 --> 11:03.680
(Mathematics Office)

11:03.680 --> 11:04.479
Jing.

11:09.670 --> 11:10.826
Getting off work so late?

11:12.400 --> 11:14.320
There was an issue with a formula check.

11:15.440 --> 11:16.119
Need help?

11:16.119 --> 11:17.719
No, it's solved.

11:21.320 --> 11:23.320
If there's nothing else, I'll go home.

11:23.560 --> 11:24.400
I didn't expect

11:25.800 --> 11:26.999
to see you here.

11:28.680 --> 11:30.680
You didn't expect someone
with my background

11:30.999 --> 11:32.599
to join this project team, right?

11:34.119 --> 11:35.119
Liu Wei.

11:38.920 --> 11:39.879
Director Wu

11:39.879 --> 11:40.999
agreed to let me stay

11:40.999 --> 11:42.400
as a teaching assistant.

11:43.839 --> 11:45.479
That's great. Congratulations.

11:46.320 --> 11:47.719
I just went to the supply store.

11:48.782 --> 11:50.350
I picked two kinds of wedding candy.

11:50.519 --> 11:52.280
Try them, and tell me which is better?

11:56.920 --> 11:57.639
What's wrong?

12:00.200 --> 12:00.999
Jing.

12:03.400 --> 12:04.879
I can't marry you.

12:06.080 --> 12:07.239
Let's break up.

12:09.320 --> 12:11.280
The school talked to me already.

12:11.715 --> 12:13.448
They said they could send me to Beijing,

12:14.440 --> 12:15.320
but...

12:17.519 --> 12:18.320
But now

12:18.920 --> 12:20.560
there's a tricky problem

12:20.560 --> 12:21.479
in front of us.

12:21.479 --> 12:22.320
You're afraid...

12:25.479 --> 12:28.119
my background will affect you.

12:30.479 --> 12:31.280
Yes.

12:32.599 --> 12:35.839
Although you've cut ties
with your parents,

12:37.239 --> 12:38.479
we both know

12:39.040 --> 12:39.800
some things

12:40.119 --> 12:42.080
can never be changed.

12:43.119 --> 12:44.440
Maybe the two of us

12:44.440 --> 12:45.920
shouldn't have been together.

12:46.737 --> 12:48.626
How can people of different backgrounds

12:49.280 --> 12:51.160
fall in love?

12:53.719 --> 12:54.599
Yeah.

12:55.071 --> 12:56.800
How can people of different backgrounds

12:57.800 --> 12:59.400
fall in love?

13:00.440 --> 13:01.239
Liu Wei.

13:03.271 --> 13:04.470
I wish you a bright future.

13:11.479 --> 13:12.519
Are your parents

13:13.560 --> 13:14.440
back?

13:15.680 --> 13:16.479
No,

13:17.119 --> 13:18.800
so our backgrounds are still different.

13:20.639 --> 13:21.400
Jing.

13:22.320 --> 13:23.200
I'm sorry.

13:23.440 --> 13:24.800
I had no choice then.

13:24.800 --> 13:26.400
There was no other option.

13:26.400 --> 13:27.879
I believe if it were you,

13:27.879 --> 13:29.320
you'd make the same choice.

13:29.320 --> 13:30.200
That's right.

13:30.519 --> 13:32.040
So you don't need to apologize.

13:32.479 --> 13:33.639
You didn't hurt me,

13:33.639 --> 13:34.999
and you couldn't hurt me.

13:36.719 --> 13:38.639
Since we're colleagues now,

13:38.999 --> 13:40.639
there's no need to mention the past.

13:41.280 --> 13:44.119
Please call me Ms. Fang from now on.

13:48.040 --> 13:48.839
Understood.

13:51.080 --> 13:54.599
Ms. Fang,
I wish us a pleasant cooperation.

13:55.648 --> 13:57.426
It doesn't matter whether it's pleasant.

13:57.599 --> 13:59.200
Just don't hold us back.

13:59.879 --> 14:00.920
I'm leaving, Mr. Liu.

14:11.300 --> 14:15.680
(Education Must Be Combined
with Productive Labor)

14:15.680 --> 14:16.200
Professor Wu.

14:16.920 --> 14:17.599
Qu Hua.

14:18.280 --> 14:19.160
What brings you here?

14:20.080 --> 14:21.119
Here to see Fang?

14:22.119 --> 14:23.320
Is she inside now?

14:23.479 --> 14:24.040
Yes.

14:24.359 --> 14:26.280
She's in a meeting at the math office.

14:26.479 --> 14:27.440
Go find her.

14:28.080 --> 14:28.519
Alright.

14:28.719 --> 14:29.519
Qu Hua.

14:30.960 --> 14:33.040
About Fang transferring
to Jiangcheng University,

14:33.800 --> 14:35.239
you support it, right?

14:57.680 --> 14:59.680
Ms. Fang, do you have a moment?

14:59.680 --> 15:01.239
I'd like to discuss a question.

15:03.280 --> 15:04.080
Go ahead.

15:08.760 --> 15:09.737
Here's the thing.

15:09.999 --> 15:11.479
I heard from Ding Yang

15:11.479 --> 15:13.239
that during your calculations,

15:13.239 --> 15:14.440
you ran into a problem

15:14.680 --> 15:16.639
that's troubled you for a long time.

15:16.639 --> 15:17.599
Earlier,

15:17.599 --> 15:19.519
I read a paper that proposed

15:19.519 --> 15:21.479
a new calculation method.

15:21.479 --> 15:22.519
I studied it.

15:22.519 --> 15:23.239
This method

15:23.239 --> 15:24.839
should greatly help us

15:24.839 --> 15:25.719
solve this problem.

15:25.719 --> 15:26.519
Look.

15:26.639 --> 15:27.400
This step.

15:28.560 --> 15:30.800
He used a new method here.

15:31.426 --> 15:32.920
And then moved from here to here?

15:32.920 --> 15:33.999
Yes.

15:33.999 --> 15:34.479
Look.

15:36.119 --> 15:36.839
Look here.

15:36.839 --> 15:37.400
Yes.

15:37.719 --> 15:38.519
Fang Mujing.

15:50.599 --> 15:51.440
Wait for me.

16:13.320 --> 16:14.119
Ms. Ding.

16:16.080 --> 16:18.119
Who is that man?

16:20.400 --> 16:21.400
Ms. Fang's husband.

16:29.080 --> 16:30.400
Are you settling in well here?

16:34.440 --> 16:35.320
I'm working.

16:35.879 --> 16:36.839
Let's talk later.

16:39.920 --> 16:41.479
I'm still at the guesthouse.

16:41.800 --> 16:42.639
Same room as before.

16:53.320 --> 16:54.920
Sorry, please continue.

16:55.239 --> 16:56.639
Sure. Well...

16:57.760 --> 16:58.560
We were at...

16:58.560 --> 16:58.999
Here.

16:59.400 --> 17:00.239
Yes, here.

17:06.640 --> 17:07.640
We finally solved it.

17:08.319 --> 17:08.840
Liu Wei.

17:08.960 --> 17:10.960
Your formula helped a lot.

17:10.960 --> 17:11.920
Thanks.

17:12.319 --> 17:13.079
It's fine.

17:13.799 --> 17:15.559
But you're still the same.

17:15.880 --> 17:16.920
When you face a problem,

17:16.920 --> 17:17.937
you fight it to the end.

17:17.937 --> 17:19.680
If it's not solved,
you won't eat or sleep.

17:19.680 --> 17:20.519
That's not good.

17:20.840 --> 17:21.920
Look how thin you are now.

17:22.840 --> 17:23.479
Jing.

17:30.239 --> 17:31.239
Ms. Fang.

17:32.880 --> 17:34.079
When did you get married?

17:34.960 --> 17:36.310
What does that have to do with you?

17:36.319 --> 17:36.840
No.

17:37.799 --> 17:40.319
I... I was just concerned about you.

17:41.400 --> 17:42.719
Thank you for your concern,

17:43.239 --> 17:44.279
but I don't need it.

17:46.640 --> 17:48.239
I heard from Ding Yang

17:48.560 --> 17:50.400
that your husband
is from a military family.

17:50.960 --> 17:53.030
His family must have
quite a lot of connections.

17:53.030 --> 17:53.848
That's right.

17:54.239 --> 17:56.319
I got into the project team
because of him.

17:56.880 --> 17:58.719
Liu Wei, isn't that
what you wanted to ask?

17:59.319 --> 18:01.039
You can't understand with my background,

18:01.182 --> 18:02.990
I wasn't even worthy
of being your girlfriend,

18:03.319 --> 18:05.120
so how could I
stand on equal footing with you

18:05.120 --> 18:06.079
and do research?

18:06.880 --> 18:08.079
Now you know the answer.

18:08.400 --> 18:09.799
Are you satisfied with it?

18:11.640 --> 18:12.120
No.

18:12.640 --> 18:14.719
Listen to yourself.

18:14.999 --> 18:15.799
Fang Mujing.

18:16.279 --> 18:18.319
Do you always have to be this aggressive

18:18.319 --> 18:20.519
and twist other people's goodwill
toward you?

18:21.440 --> 18:22.279
Right now,

18:22.279 --> 18:24.160
I honestly feel sorry for your husband.

18:24.559 --> 18:27.160
Didn't you marry him just
for his family's connections?

18:28.200 --> 18:29.239
Do you really love him?

18:29.239 --> 18:30.719
Does he know all this?

18:31.479 --> 18:32.319
I do.

18:40.479 --> 18:41.440
But I don't care.

18:44.440 --> 18:45.400
Why are you here?

18:45.915 --> 18:47.790
Didn't we say we'd meet
at the guesthouse?

18:49.479 --> 18:50.160
It's late.

18:50.382 --> 18:52.426
I thought it might not be safe
on your way there.

18:52.680 --> 18:53.680
But I didn't expect

18:54.004 --> 18:55.470
the school to be even less safe.

18:58.519 --> 18:59.319
Liu Wei.

19:02.039 --> 19:04.239
Thank you for your concern for my wife.

19:04.719 --> 19:07.120
But matters between the two of us

19:07.319 --> 19:09.079
don't need outsiders' worry.

19:14.680 --> 19:16.319
Mujing, let's go back.

19:28.780 --> 19:32.220
(Jiangcheng No. 2 Guesthouse)

19:49.920 --> 19:51.640
I thought this outfit
looked nice on you,

19:51.640 --> 19:52.640
so I brought it over.

20:12.479 --> 20:13.519
Why didn't you discuss

20:13.960 --> 20:15.319
coming to Jiangcheng with me first?

20:15.719 --> 20:16.880
If you agreed,

20:16.915 --> 20:18.515
I wouldn't need to discuss it with you.

20:18.920 --> 20:20.069
If you disagree,

20:20.070 --> 20:21.826
there'd be no point
in discussing it either.

20:22.079 --> 20:23.840
So I made the decision myself.

20:24.315 --> 20:26.510
Shouldn't you
at least have informed me in person?

20:26.719 --> 20:27.719
I did inform you.

20:28.279 --> 20:30.279
You were drunk and didn't hear it.

20:36.960 --> 20:37.719
That day

20:38.600 --> 20:39.840
was Yan's death anniversary.

20:43.920 --> 20:45.079
I did drink too much.

20:46.079 --> 20:47.079
I apologize.

20:49.440 --> 20:50.239
I understand.

20:52.680 --> 20:54.279
Then what's going on with Liu Wei?

20:54.999 --> 20:57.479
He does
pure theoretical mathematics research.

20:57.999 --> 20:58.920
His English is excellent

20:58.970 --> 21:01.120
and is very familiar
with cutting-edge foreign papers.

21:01.120 --> 21:02.760
I'm not asking about his academic work.

21:03.319 --> 21:04.120
I'm asking

21:04.640 --> 21:06.400
whether he's your ex-boyfriend.

21:06.880 --> 21:07.719
Yes.

21:08.120 --> 21:09.519
We dated for three years in college.

21:09.519 --> 21:11.069
So you transferred here because of him?

21:11.070 --> 21:12.271
It has nothing to do with him.

21:12.719 --> 21:13.709
I only found out

21:13.710 --> 21:15.560
he was in the project team
after I transferred.

21:16.319 --> 21:17.120
Fang Mujing.

21:17.680 --> 21:19.120
Even if you married me

21:19.120 --> 21:20.999
for a better family background,

21:20.999 --> 21:22.640
I still hope you understand

21:22.799 --> 21:24.279
that there are certain principles

21:24.640 --> 21:26.999
you should follow since you married me.

21:26.999 --> 21:27.799
Such as?

21:28.640 --> 21:30.440
You and your ex
are in the same project team.

21:30.440 --> 21:32.479
Shouldn't you
have told me, your husband?

21:32.999 --> 21:33.519
Besides,

21:34.039 --> 21:36.999
shouldn't you
maintain an appropriate distance?

21:39.079 --> 21:40.680
An appropriate distance?

21:50.519 --> 21:51.920
Does this count as appropriate?

21:58.640 --> 22:00.239
Qu Hua, don't do this.

22:00.719 --> 22:02.719
Or I'll misunderstand
and think you're jealous.

22:13.600 --> 22:14.519
Don't worry.

22:15.479 --> 22:16.880
Liu Wei and I ended long ago.

22:17.120 --> 22:18.400
We're just colleagues now.

22:19.999 --> 22:21.749
I'm not good

22:21.750 --> 22:23.026
at holding onto the past.

22:25.880 --> 22:26.799
Unlike you.

22:29.319 --> 22:30.479
Ask

22:30.915 --> 22:32.440
anything you want to know about Yan.

22:35.640 --> 22:36.640
I'm not interested.

22:37.426 --> 22:39.115
I can play
the role of a substitute well,

22:39.680 --> 22:40.200
but please

22:40.200 --> 22:42.319
don't make any extra demands of me.

22:43.239 --> 22:45.039
When did I ever say
you were a substitute?

22:45.200 --> 22:46.079
Am I not?

22:51.680 --> 22:52.920
I can stay here tonight.

23:11.559 --> 23:14.039
(Qu Hua)
(I have a surgery. I'll head back.)

23:41.239 --> 23:42.559
Long time no see, Fang Muyang.

23:43.360 --> 23:43.880
Hua.

23:44.600 --> 23:45.880
What brings you to Jiangcheng?

23:46.120 --> 23:47.239
A meeting or surgery?

23:48.039 --> 23:49.079
I came to see your sister.

23:49.737 --> 23:50.880
My sister came to Jiangcheng?

23:51.880 --> 23:53.479
She's been here for half a month.

23:53.479 --> 23:54.479
You didn't know?

23:57.719 --> 23:58.719
She's unbelievable.

24:01.400 --> 24:03.799
She transferred to
Jiangcheng University's Math Department.

24:04.279 --> 24:05.640
Even though she's from Jiangcheng,

24:06.079 --> 24:08.079
it seems she doesn't
have many friends here.

24:08.719 --> 24:10.799
If you have time, go visit her.

24:11.039 --> 24:12.200
Have a meal with her.

24:12.200 --> 24:12.799
Help her relax.

24:13.600 --> 24:14.079
No problem.

24:17.600 --> 24:18.400
No need.

24:18.400 --> 24:20.200
My training program offers subsidies.

24:20.479 --> 24:21.479
It's not for you.

24:21.920 --> 24:23.999
It's for you
to take your sister out for a meal.

24:24.200 --> 24:26.004
Why didn't you give it to her yourself?

24:33.600 --> 24:34.400
Hua.

24:35.582 --> 24:37.715
Did something happen
between you and my sister?

24:37.999 --> 24:39.479
When I married your sister,

24:39.880 --> 24:41.239
a big part of the reason

24:41.239 --> 24:42.719
was my admiration for her rationality.

24:43.200 --> 24:45.200
But after marriage, I realized

24:45.640 --> 24:48.440
sometimes being too rational
lacks a bit of...

24:49.200 --> 24:50.319
A bit of warmth.

24:53.920 --> 24:54.920
I was the last

24:55.239 --> 24:56.799
to know about her transfer.

24:57.640 --> 24:59.039
Sometimes I wonder

24:59.440 --> 25:00.319
what I, her husband,

25:00.920 --> 25:01.960
and our family,

25:02.279 --> 25:04.920
really mean to her.

25:06.920 --> 25:07.600
Hua.

25:09.479 --> 25:10.319
Don't worry.

25:10.880 --> 25:12.319
I was the last to know

25:12.640 --> 25:14.039
about her transfer.

25:15.382 --> 25:16.840
My sister is very much like my mom.

25:17.400 --> 25:19.759
She's been excellent since childhood,

25:20.719 --> 25:21.680
so she's proud.

25:22.719 --> 25:23.600
Our parents

25:24.920 --> 25:26.079
had a huge impact on her.

25:26.880 --> 25:28.719
You might think my sister married you

25:28.719 --> 25:29.799
because of your family,

25:30.640 --> 25:31.920
but from what I know of her,

25:33.319 --> 25:34.120
it's not entirely so.

25:38.319 --> 25:39.120
Fang Muyang.

25:40.319 --> 25:43.120
Do you think a wrong beginning

25:44.479 --> 25:46.279
can possibly lead to

25:46.880 --> 25:47.920
a right result?

25:49.071 --> 25:50.271
It depends on the person.

25:58.200 --> 25:58.999
Alright.

25:59.279 --> 26:00.840
I'll accept this for my sister.

26:02.279 --> 26:03.079
Thank you then.

26:03.799 --> 26:04.600
I have to go.

26:04.710 --> 26:05.639
I need to catch a train.

26:05.640 --> 26:06.160
Alright.

26:06.360 --> 26:07.600
- Goodbye.
- Goodbye.

26:14.319 --> 26:15.559
These two are so alike.

26:16.660 --> 26:19.600
(Jiangnan Municipal People's Hospital)

26:19.600 --> 26:20.600
Thank you, Doctor.

26:20.600 --> 26:30.580
(Doctor's Office)

26:36.319 --> 26:37.989
Dr. Qu, the hospital director wants you.

26:37.990 --> 26:39.515
He wants you to go over immediately.

26:40.440 --> 26:41.120
Alright.

26:49.319 --> 26:49.999
Xia.

26:50.400 --> 26:51.600
Any calls for me today?

26:52.120 --> 26:52.880
No.

27:00.680 --> 27:02.440
Hello, any letters for me today?

27:02.680 --> 27:03.400
No.

27:09.920 --> 27:12.200
Dr. Qu, a patient's condition
is quite critical.

27:12.200 --> 27:13.869
Emergency surgery is needed immediately.

27:13.870 --> 27:14.710
Please go at once.

27:14.719 --> 27:15.479
Alright.

27:18.079 --> 27:19.039
Any calls for me?

27:19.319 --> 27:20.039
No.

27:29.079 --> 27:29.880
Fei Ni.

27:32.440 --> 27:33.039
Ms. Liu.

27:33.039 --> 27:33.600
Fei Ni.

27:34.319 --> 27:35.319
There's something.

27:35.319 --> 27:36.200
Our city

27:36.200 --> 27:37.200
is organizing

27:37.200 --> 27:39.999
a citywide blackboard newspaper contest
for the industrial system.

27:40.200 --> 27:41.319
Our factory's

27:41.400 --> 27:42.479
every workshop

27:42.479 --> 27:45.319
and department must make
their own blackboard newspaper.

27:46.337 --> 27:47.226
If it's done well,

27:47.360 --> 27:49.719
it'll represent the factory
in the city contest.

27:51.279 --> 27:52.400
I plan to

27:52.400 --> 27:55.039
entrust Workshop One's
blackboard newspaper to you.

27:55.479 --> 27:56.160
Will you do it?

27:56.360 --> 27:58.239
Of course.

27:58.880 --> 28:01.440
Are there any requirements
for this blackboard newspaper?

28:01.440 --> 28:04.039
It should show Jiangcheng
No. 1 Textile Factory's positive,

28:04.120 --> 28:05.079
energetic,

28:05.079 --> 28:06.840
and never-give-up spirit.

28:07.640 --> 28:08.719
If done well,

28:08.719 --> 28:09.920
Ms. Xu said

28:09.990 --> 28:11.648
she'll give five yuan to the person

28:11.715 --> 28:13.048
who does the blackboard newspaper.

28:14.600 --> 28:16.479
How about it? Can you do it?

28:16.519 --> 28:17.640
I'll make sure to finish it.

28:18.319 --> 28:18.840
Alright.

28:19.719 --> 28:21.600
But there's one thing I must remind you.

28:21.920 --> 28:23.509
The supervisor for this blackboard

28:23.510 --> 28:25.782
is Feng Lin from our factory office.

28:26.680 --> 28:29.279
You must cooperate with her
to complete the task.

28:31.200 --> 28:31.920
Understood.

28:32.120 --> 28:32.920
Good.

28:36.920 --> 28:37.920
The left section

28:38.604 --> 28:41.440
should write about learning
the theory of proletarian dictatorship.

28:43.880 --> 28:46.400
The right section should write
"Labor is the most glorious.

28:46.400 --> 28:48.120
Women hold up half the sky".

28:49.039 --> 28:50.039
The middle section

28:51.737 --> 28:52.840
should leave some space

28:53.319 --> 28:54.640
to post an article.

28:55.440 --> 28:56.719
What article?

29:01.719 --> 29:02.600
Praise of Heroes.

29:03.182 --> 29:04.980
(Red hearts forged in fire,
valleys echo with battle songs.)

29:04.981 --> 29:06.540
(Steel casts the nation's shield.
Cotton threads build its greatness.)

29:07.600 --> 29:10.039
Who wrote this?

29:10.920 --> 29:11.719
I did.

29:15.079 --> 29:16.479
Feng Lin.

29:17.319 --> 29:19.200
Shouldn't Workshop One's
blackboard newspaper

29:19.799 --> 29:21.719
at least reflect

29:21.719 --> 29:24.519
our production achievements

29:24.519 --> 29:27.239
and the lives
of ordinary frontline workers?

29:27.239 --> 29:27.960
This

29:28.719 --> 29:31.400
might not be very appropriate
to put here.

29:31.920 --> 29:33.799
Whether it's appropriate
is for me to decide.

29:34.440 --> 29:35.479
My article

29:35.640 --> 29:37.719
was specifically written
for the big contest.

29:38.279 --> 29:39.600
Ms. Xu approved it.

29:39.915 --> 29:42.115
What right do you have
to say it's inappropriate?

29:42.680 --> 29:43.799
Just write it as is.

29:51.780 --> 29:54.100
(Praise of Heroes)

29:58.640 --> 29:59.160
Fei Ni.

30:01.400 --> 30:02.680
Can you read the stars?

30:03.319 --> 30:04.239
Stars?

30:04.880 --> 30:06.200
Aren't they right there?

30:07.680 --> 30:09.319
Can you see Ursa Minor?

30:13.719 --> 30:14.719
Don't panic.

30:15.230 --> 30:17.048
The more you look,
the more stars you see.

30:17.479 --> 30:18.319
Look.

30:18.719 --> 30:20.319
These stars connected together

30:20.319 --> 30:21.640
form a little bear.

30:22.719 --> 30:24.120
These four are its body.

30:24.715 --> 30:25.840
This one is the front paw.

30:25.999 --> 30:27.079
That one is the back paw.

30:27.880 --> 30:29.519
The North Star is one of its feet.

30:31.840 --> 30:33.920
If you follow the North Star,

30:34.319 --> 30:35.799
will you reach the north?

30:47.799 --> 30:48.719
Fang Muyang.

30:50.360 --> 30:52.400
I just... I'm not...

30:52.400 --> 30:53.239
I'm not...

30:53.319 --> 30:55.120
I have a bold idea.

30:56.893 --> 30:58.271
What are you going to do?

30:58.382 --> 31:00.200
Tear down
Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory?

31:00.200 --> 31:01.239
Not that bold.

31:02.440 --> 31:04.479
We're making
the blackboard newspaper now.

31:04.920 --> 31:07.319
Our workshop is working with Feng Lin.

31:07.920 --> 31:09.799
She wants to copy her article on it.

31:09.920 --> 31:12.719
I won't say whose is better for now.

31:13.799 --> 31:15.799
I just think her article

31:15.799 --> 31:16.640
is copied

31:16.640 --> 31:18.400
from here and there,

31:19.719 --> 31:21.880
so I wonder

31:22.799 --> 31:25.319
why not try putting my article up?

31:26.319 --> 31:28.079
I'm not saying mine is better than hers.

31:28.200 --> 31:28.999
I just wrote

31:28.999 --> 31:31.999
about our workshop colleagues
helping each other

31:31.999 --> 31:33.079
to improve production,

31:33.319 --> 31:35.719
and it fits
the theme of this big contest.

31:37.440 --> 31:38.400
What do you think?

31:45.319 --> 31:46.719
Such a risky thing

31:49.804 --> 31:51.640
must be done
under the cover of darkness.

31:54.920 --> 31:55.719
Let's go.

31:58.239 --> 31:59.039
Slow down.

32:11.200 --> 32:11.799
Fei Ni.

32:12.160 --> 32:12.920
Do you know

32:12.999 --> 32:15.079
what movements you textile women do

32:15.200 --> 32:16.319
at work?

32:19.039 --> 32:21.319
Throw the shuttle, pull the levers,

32:21.600 --> 32:22.640
and lift the yarn.

32:22.640 --> 32:23.120
Don't move.

32:26.400 --> 32:27.200
This is it.

32:28.239 --> 32:29.039
A little higher.

32:42.079 --> 32:42.920
Don't move.

32:45.039 --> 32:45.840
It itches.

32:45.840 --> 32:46.937
Hold still a bit longer.

32:50.740 --> 32:54.860
♪Time quietly reveals♪

32:55.460 --> 32:59.020
♪Those rising heartbeats♪

32:59.740 --> 33:03.740
♪In my eyes, there's always a rainbow♪

33:04.100 --> 33:07.060
♪Paving the road to our dreams♪

33:07.500 --> 33:11.260
♪Those days and nights we shared♪

33:11.620 --> 33:15.340
♪Are etched deep in memory♪

33:16.020 --> 33:19.020
♪How I wish
I could write everything down♪

33:19.380 --> 33:24.100
♪Your care, my love♪

33:26.940 --> 33:31.420
♪Because of you♪

33:31.740 --> 33:37.540
♪The ordinary days in my world
turn bright♪

33:37.900 --> 33:40.820
♪Rich and precious♪

33:41.220 --> 33:46.180
♪How I wish I could
be a firefly for you in the night♪

33:46.180 --> 33:50.220
♪Guiding you toward the horizon
as you go to see a wider world♪

33:50.580 --> 33:53.780
♪How lucky we are
to have chosen each other♪

33:53.780 --> 33:57.500
♪Our hearts shine for each other♪

33:57.500 --> 34:02.380
♪Let me become
a firework that shines for you forever♪

34:02.380 --> 34:06.460
♪Burning with endless light,
I'll tell our story with my life♪

34:06.460 --> 34:10.180
♪Stars lean into the twilight,
you lean on me♪

34:10.180 --> 34:15.580
♪For the rest of our lives,
let's not count the years♪

34:15.880 --> 34:16.679
Continue writing.

34:16.679 --> 34:19.940
♪I'll walk beside you♪

34:19.940 --> 34:24.860
♪How I wish I could
be a firefly for you in the night♪

34:24.860 --> 34:28.860
♪Guiding you toward the horizon
as you go to see a wider world♪

34:28.860 --> 34:32.380
♪How lucky we are
to have chosen each other♪

34:32.380 --> 34:36.140
♪Our hearts shine for each other♪

34:36.140 --> 34:41.140
♪Let me become
a firework that shines for you forever♪

34:41.140 --> 34:44.900
♪Burning with endless light,
I'll tell our story with my life♪

34:44.900 --> 34:48.540
♪Stars lean into the twilight,
you lean on me♪

34:48.540 --> 34:54.380
♪For the rest of our lives,
let's not count the years♪

34:54.826 --> 34:56.630
Fang Muyang,
thank you for your hard work.

34:59.240 --> 35:00.840
You must be hungry.

35:01.470 --> 35:02.439
Where did you get them?

35:02.440 --> 35:04.160
I brought it specially
before I left home.

35:12.400 --> 35:13.720
Fei Ni, please inspect.

35:21.260 --> 35:22.869
(New Textile Technique)

35:22.870 --> 35:28.021
(Our twill cotton, woven
with craftsmanship, is widely praised.)

35:28.022 --> 35:32.180
(Take initiative,
responsible, strive for miracles.)

35:57.519 --> 35:58.519
I'm done.

35:59.119 --> 35:59.920
Let's go out.

36:04.470 --> 36:05.760
I'll wait for you downstairs.

36:13.980 --> 36:19.140
(Jiangcheng No. 1 Textile Factory)

36:19.671 --> 36:21.800
Look, this blackboard newspaper
is really nice.

36:22.079 --> 36:22.880
It's really nice.

36:22.920 --> 36:23.720
Ms. Liu.

36:24.599 --> 36:25.679
Fei Ni.

36:25.840 --> 36:27.240
When did you write this?

36:28.639 --> 36:29.920
I didn't want to delay work.

36:29.920 --> 36:31.519
I stayed up and wrote it last night.

36:31.920 --> 36:33.720
How is it? Is it alright?

36:34.079 --> 36:37.320
Amazing. Your handwriting is beautiful.

36:37.519 --> 36:38.440
And the drawings

36:38.720 --> 36:40.280
are so vivid.

36:40.679 --> 36:41.440
And this line,

36:42.440 --> 36:44.880
"Our twill cotton,
woven with craftsmanship,

36:44.880 --> 36:47.639
is widely praised."

36:47.639 --> 36:49.840
This describes our workshop's product.

36:49.840 --> 36:50.639
Yes.

36:50.840 --> 36:53.280
Our twill cotton is popular.

36:53.280 --> 36:55.079
Our workshop worked overtime

36:55.079 --> 36:56.039
together

36:56.039 --> 36:57.800
to overcome all difficulties

36:57.800 --> 36:59.280
and complete this tough task,

36:59.440 --> 37:02.079
so I think it's worth
recording on the board.

37:02.320 --> 37:04.479
This is indeed an exemplary achievement.

37:05.999 --> 37:08.920
This blackboard newspaper
was done fast and well.

37:10.639 --> 37:11.360
Fei Ni.

37:11.360 --> 37:12.479
This is so well written.

37:14.226 --> 37:15.920
What's with this blackboard newspaper?

37:21.840 --> 37:23.400
What's wrong, Feng Lin?

37:23.848 --> 37:24.760
Who changed it?

37:24.760 --> 37:27.020
What happened to the Praise of Heroes
I asked you to write?

37:27.982 --> 37:28.800
Here's the thing.

37:28.800 --> 37:29.679
Feng Lin.

37:29.679 --> 37:31.920
I think your Praise of Heroes
is especially good,

37:31.920 --> 37:33.519
but it's a bit

37:33.519 --> 37:34.599
detached.

37:35.240 --> 37:36.320
Since our factory

37:36.320 --> 37:38.626
asks each workshop
to make its own blackboard newspaper,

37:38.720 --> 37:41.119
I want to praise every ordinary person
in our workshop.

37:41.599 --> 37:42.920
You're just making excuses.

37:43.240 --> 37:45.119
How is my Praise of Heroes detached?

37:46.720 --> 37:48.079
This is retaliation.

37:48.079 --> 37:49.079
Disobedience.

37:49.079 --> 37:50.079
Feng Lin.

37:50.240 --> 37:52.079
I won't let you pin that label on me.

37:52.079 --> 37:53.119
I can't take it.

37:53.137 --> 37:54.440
I'm following your instructions.

37:54.440 --> 37:55.320
Stop talking nonsense.

37:55.679 --> 37:57.479
I'm just asking if you'll change it.

38:03.800 --> 38:04.599
No.

38:05.160 --> 38:07.070
This is our workshop's
blackboard newspaper.

38:07.400 --> 38:09.599
I must make sure
our colleagues can understand it.

38:09.599 --> 38:11.079
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:11.079 --> 38:12.360
We all think it's good.

38:12.382 --> 38:13.510
This blackboard newspaper

38:13.519 --> 38:15.360
should write about our workshop's work.

38:15.559 --> 38:17.599
Yes, no problem at all.

38:17.920 --> 38:18.800
Alright!

38:20.800 --> 38:21.840
I can't deal with you.

38:22.320 --> 38:23.679
Someone else can.

38:29.720 --> 38:30.760
She's most likely

38:31.280 --> 38:33.039
going to Ms. Xu

38:33.039 --> 38:34.039
to report you.

38:38.599 --> 38:39.400
Go ahead.

38:39.715 --> 38:41.400
I was worried she wouldn't report it.

38:44.039 --> 38:45.079
Fei.

38:51.519 --> 38:52.039
Ms. Xu.

38:52.320 --> 38:53.720
Fei Ni is out of control.

38:53.720 --> 38:55.893
She refused to promote
Mao Zedong Thought when asked.

38:55.893 --> 38:57.639
She refused
to praise collectivism either.

38:57.640 --> 39:00.350
She insists on promoting individualism
in the blackboard newspaper.

39:01.519 --> 39:03.920
Workshop One is outrageous.

39:05.840 --> 39:06.639
Fei Ni.

39:07.479 --> 39:08.679
I heard you're promoting

39:08.679 --> 39:10.079
individualism on the blackboard.

39:10.440 --> 39:11.240
Who said that?

39:11.240 --> 39:12.079
I did.

39:12.079 --> 39:14.079
You promote individualism
on the blackboard

39:14.079 --> 39:15.639
and don't praise collectivism.

39:15.639 --> 39:17.599
Is it wrong for me to promote Ms. Xu?

39:21.400 --> 39:23.519
Under the resolute path of advancement,

39:23.519 --> 39:25.479
led by factory director, Xu Hongqi,

39:25.479 --> 39:27.720
Workshop One workers
overcame all difficulties

39:27.720 --> 39:30.079
and completed
the twill cotton production task.

39:30.639 --> 39:31.720
Feng Lin.

39:31.720 --> 39:34.079
Are you saying that by promoting Ms. Xu,

39:34.079 --> 39:35.639
I'm promoting individualism?

39:35.720 --> 39:36.989
I think Ms. Xu represents

39:36.990 --> 39:39.293
the collective of the entire
Jiangcheng Textile Factory.

39:39.293 --> 39:40.720
Ms. Xu, I didn't mean that.

39:40.720 --> 39:42.840
Ms. Xu wasn't even mentioned just now.

39:42.840 --> 39:44.079
How could it be?

39:44.479 --> 39:45.119
Last year,

39:45.119 --> 39:46.519
the twill cotton production task

39:46.519 --> 39:48.079
was assigned by Ms. Xu.

39:48.079 --> 39:49.999
No one can erase Ms. Xu's contribution.

39:49.999 --> 39:50.880
No, Ms. Xu.

39:50.880 --> 39:51.679
Enough.

39:54.599 --> 39:56.159
This contest

39:56.400 --> 39:57.440
is meant to showcase

39:57.440 --> 39:59.400
the new image of socialist workers

39:59.519 --> 40:00.400
and inspire everyone

40:00.400 --> 40:03.400
to keep striving for socialism.

40:04.079 --> 40:05.280
If we talk about praise,

40:05.280 --> 40:07.479
we should first praise

40:07.920 --> 40:09.599
every worker who made a contribution.

40:13.199 --> 40:13.840
Look.

40:14.679 --> 40:16.720
The last two paragraphs are very good.

40:17.519 --> 40:18.479
And the illustrations

40:18.479 --> 40:19.639
are lively.

40:22.519 --> 40:23.840
As young as you are,

40:23.840 --> 40:26.280
never develop the habit of flattering.

40:26.880 --> 40:27.519
I understand.

40:27.519 --> 40:28.079
Ms. Xu.

40:28.920 --> 40:30.840
Change all the parts with my name.

40:31.280 --> 40:33.039
Later, I'll have all the workshops

40:33.039 --> 40:34.679
come study this.

40:34.679 --> 40:36.280
Alright, I'll change it immediately.

40:38.840 --> 40:39.559
Don't always

40:39.559 --> 40:41.479
pin labels on other people.

40:42.199 --> 40:43.679
It affects unity.

40:43.800 --> 40:44.720
Sorry, Ms. Xu.

40:47.760 --> 40:48.360
Change it.

40:52.540 --> 40:56.020
(Jiangcheng People's Publishing House,
Jiangcheng Daily)

40:56.880 --> 40:57.479
Mr. Yuan.

40:57.999 --> 41:00.360
(Yuan Jiashang)
This kid is talented at drawing.

41:02.679 --> 41:03.960
Uncle Fu, you wanted me?

41:04.519 --> 41:05.280
Yang.

41:05.679 --> 41:07.079
Let me introduce you.

41:07.079 --> 41:09.840
This is the famous Mr. Yuan Jiashang.

41:10.400 --> 41:13.400
He has a great influence
on Jiangcheng's art industry.

41:13.400 --> 41:13.999
Mr. Yuan.

41:14.320 --> 41:15.039
Hello.

41:15.280 --> 41:16.079
Hello, Fang.

41:16.519 --> 41:18.199
This is Fang Muyang
I told you about.

41:19.079 --> 41:19.880
Fang.

41:20.400 --> 41:21.679
I saw your painting.

41:21.920 --> 41:22.920
They're good.

41:24.639 --> 41:25.159
Mr. Yuan.

41:25.639 --> 41:26.840
I've seen your artwork, too.

41:26.999 --> 41:28.320
They're good, too.

41:30.199 --> 41:32.679
Can you draw another one in front of me?

41:33.226 --> 41:34.320
You can pick any theme.

41:34.320 --> 41:35.119
No problem.

41:36.039 --> 41:37.440
But if I did well,

41:37.880 --> 41:39.079
will you treat me to a meal?

41:39.599 --> 41:40.440
What?

41:40.880 --> 41:42.960
Has the training class let you starve?

41:44.119 --> 41:45.519
If you did a good job,

41:45.720 --> 41:46.720
no problem.

42:18.893 --> 42:20.190
What would you like to eat?

42:27.679 --> 42:28.159
Fang.

42:29.440 --> 42:29.840
I heard

42:29.840 --> 42:31.479
your newspaper's training class

42:31.479 --> 42:32.360
is about to end.

42:33.440 --> 42:35.360
Have you thought about what to do next?

42:37.840 --> 42:38.559
Not yet.

42:39.119 --> 42:40.559
Come help me draw comics.

42:40.559 --> 42:41.440
Are you interested?

42:43.119 --> 42:43.519
Me?

42:43.920 --> 42:45.320
My comics

42:45.760 --> 42:46.960
are somewhat popular.

42:47.639 --> 42:49.440
But I have too many commissions.

42:49.920 --> 42:51.039
I have limited energy.

42:51.039 --> 42:52.320
I can't draw all myself.

42:53.240 --> 42:54.800
So I want you to draw the rough drafts

42:55.320 --> 42:56.280
with no signature,

42:56.760 --> 42:58.159
but I'll give you some allowance.

42:58.280 --> 42:59.079
How about it?

43:00.960 --> 43:01.639
Sure.

43:04.720 --> 43:05.519
Mr. Yuan.

43:06.119 --> 43:07.240
I have one more request.

43:08.280 --> 43:08.960
Go ahead.

43:11.440 --> 43:13.404
Can I take some food home?

43:28.860 --> 43:33.340
♪After the laughter, I think of you♪

43:35.900 --> 43:40.620
♪After the storm, I think of you♪

43:43.140 --> 43:49.260
♪In the little courtyard,
there you are dancing♪

43:50.260 --> 43:54.820
♪That earnest you,
smiling so innocently♪

43:57.300 --> 44:02.060
♪In spring, I stay by your side♪

44:04.500 --> 44:08.860
♪When summer comes, I watch over you♪

44:11.220 --> 44:17.860
♪In the light of dawn, you belong to me♪

44:17.860 --> 44:27.460
♪At the edge of the world,
I will still hold you tight♪

44:28.540 --> 44:34.700
♪There is a small place♪

44:34.700 --> 44:41.500
♪Where they carry big dreams♪

44:41.500 --> 44:48.860
♪Every lovely face♪

44:49.740 --> 44:55.900
♪Shines brightly in the heart♪

44:56.700 --> 45:02.740
♪Even when we collide,
we hold our course♪

45:03.940 --> 45:09.740
♪Even when we stumble,
we keep our resolve♪

45:10.820 --> 45:17.100
♪My you, walking toward the distance♪

45:17.900 --> 45:26.140
♪Please carry our dreams
and let them soar♪
